  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>Thanks to your generosity, we have hit our goal! Without your support, I wouldn’t be able to spend my days digging into all of the best research and deliver it straight to you. NutritionFacts.org gets royalties from my books, but the number one funding stream that keeps us thriving is individual contributions from people like you. A huge <em>thank you/gracias/cheers/xièxiè/dankie/merci </em>from all our staff scattered across the globe in six countries.</p>\n<p>Thanks to the collective enthusiasm for sharing NutritionFacts.org by our 3 million subscribers and followers, we averaged 3.5 million page and almost 2 million video views per month this year. But it’s not about the numbers; it’s about the people whose lives we’ve touched, changed, or even saved. A heartfelt thank you to <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">everyone</a> who has made this public service possible.</p>\n<p>Please consider investing in my work by making a tax-deductible <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">donation</a> to NutritionFacts.org, <span style=\"color: #134f5c;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1608149512361000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEoye-iypctE3ON0EAqHFVAXE6yNA\">using a credit card or PayPal</a>,</span> or you can send a check to: <strong>NutritionFacts.org, </strong><strong>6800 Wisconsin Avenue #1185, </strong><strong>Chevy Chase, MD 20815</strong>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Download the Free Evidence-Based Eating Guide</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-66299 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Eating guide\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/SM-Eating-Guide-Slider_03.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>As you get ready for 2021 and healthy resolutions, remember we have a free downloadable guide that summarizes my Traffic Light and Daily Dozen systems, as well as tips and simple recipes. Get your <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/s6nmnbkj9c2fdio0qua2bze5ko5ogqch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://brandfolder.com/s/xv7zpt7g6h38jpbbmcj8hjch\">free download here</a>, or order <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/outreach/products/healthkit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/outreach/products/healthkit\">hard copies here</a> at cost.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"460\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-65577 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"How to Reverse Heart Failure with Diet\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/11/51-26-How-to-Reverse-Heart-Failure-with-Diet.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 250px) 100vw, 250px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-reverse-heart-failure-with-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to Reverse Heart Failure with Diet</a></p>\n<p>Can you reverse heart disease with food? An entire issue of a cardiology journal dedicated to plant-based nutrition explores the role an evidence-based diet can play in the reversal of congestive heart failure.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-57466 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"FBF - Dark Chocolate and Artery Function\" width=\"249\" height=\"140\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/FBF-Dark-Chocolate-and-Artery-Function.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 249px) 100vw, 249px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/flashback-friday-chocolate-and-stroke-risk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Flashback Friday: Chocolate and Stroke Risk</a></p>\n<p>Dark chocolate is pitted against milk chocolate in a test of artery function.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-65667 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Do Vitamin B12 Supplements Cause Bone Fractures and Lung Cancer?\" width=\"250\" height=\"140\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/12/52-02-Do-Vitamin-B12-Supplements-Cause-Bone-Fractures-and-Lung-Cancer.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 250px) 100vw, 250px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/do-vitamin-b12-supplements-cause-bone-fractures-and-lung-cancer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Do Vitamin B12 Supplements Cause Bone Fractures and Lung Cancer?</a></p>\n<p>The connection between B12, bone health and cancer. What do randomized controlled trials of high-dose daily vitamin B12 supplementation show about the effects on cancer risk, death, and longevity?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
